    "body": "- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\nIn `mini-basics.txt` I fixed a typo on line 291 ('easiere' -> 'easier'). I did make some changes to the grammar and flow in several places.\r\n\r\nFirst time contributing!\r\n\r\n*oops, i forgot to commit the .lua file gimme a sec",
